# Keep user content and secrets out of build contexts and images.
#
# backend/Dockerfile does `COPY backend/ .`, which was pulling backend/uploads/
# -- 50 real user photos, ~76MB -- into every image. Docker then seeds any
# fresh named volume mounted at /app/uploads from the image, which is how the
# dev stack ended up holding copies of production photos.
backend/uploads/

# Secrets are never needed at build time.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build/VCS noise.
.git/
.gitignore
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/node_modules/
frontend/build/
*.db
*.sqlite*

# Ops and docs are not part of any image.
ops/
*.md
